<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH JAN REAL AGRICULTURE SALES +2.7 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH JAN REAL AGRICULTURE SALES +2.7 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real agricultural sales in January were 2.7 percent higher, year-on-year, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The CSU added that the average monthly wage in the sector was 12.4 percent higher in January than in the same month of the previous year.  </p>
<p>The CSU said the number of people employed by the agriculture sector fell by 5.4 percent, year-on-year, in January.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
